{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nourish</strong> is a retro-styled 3D horror game about survival, responsibility, and the terrifying cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 15 minute challenging experience, you play as a junior employee of Echium Enterprises, you're tasked with transporting <i>Project V\u00e1yu</i>,\u00a0a mysterious plant discovered on a distant alien world. Early research suggests it could solve Echium\u2019s oxygen shortage aboard deep-space vessels. But in isolation, far from home, you quickly realize the plant is growing... <i>hungry</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time and dwindling resources carefully. Feed the plant. Maintain the ship. Survive.<br>Because if V\u00e1yu dies \u2014 you do too.<br> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.webp?t=1761329525\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.poster.avif?t=1761329525\" class=\"bb_img\" width=188 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rescued","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703030/8a978aefca8538e622fd7e4c8e9dd676b20a857b.jpg"},{"name":"Nyeef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703030/39a1e78ecd5a06c695b294e6c67478fc0bb5e8c9.jpg"},{"name":"Rescued Challenge Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703030/cd35b0614a196f0343c4b